WEBVTT

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:04.625
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:00:04.791 --> 00:00:07.291
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:09.958
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:14.375
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.583
<c.Caption-C6_1>Moshimo genki wo nakushite

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.916
<c.Caption-C7_1>Tohouni kuretatokiniwa

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:38.000
<c.Caption-C8_1>Popotan no koe wo kikuno

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:42.083
<c.Caption-C9_1>Souyo anataga sunaoni

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:44.500
<c.Caption-C10_1>Natte kokoro wo hirakeba

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:48.875
<c.Caption-C11_1>Popotan wa oshiete kureru

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.666
<c.Caption-C12_1>Anohito wa kuru? Konai?

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.416
<c.Caption-C13_1>Watashi wo suki? Kirai?

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.166
<c.Caption-C14_1>Konokoi wa uso? Honto?

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:02.333
<c.Caption-C15_1>Donna kotomo shitteruno

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:05.875
<c.Caption-C16_1>Moudame popopo

00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:08.750
<c.Caption-C17_1>Moudame popopo

00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:13.958
<c.Caption-C18_1>Wakatterukedo yamerarenai

00:01:14.041 --> 00:01:16.416
<c.Caption-C19_1>Moumuri popopo

00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:18.833
<c.Caption-C20_1>Moumuri popopo

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:24.541
<c.Caption-C21_1>Yume no yumedemo akeramenaide

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.875
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.750
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>Ai! Breakfast is ready!

00:01:42.291 --> 00:01:44.958
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>No, not that button.

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:47.000
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>Wake up! Mii!

00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:50.791
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>So, penguins are birds.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.833
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>Wake up now!

00:01:56.166 --> 00:01:57.875
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>You're so loud, Mai!

00:01:57.875 --> 00:01:58.916
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>We've got something important!

00:01:58.916 --> 00:02:00.833
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>So noisy early in the morning.

00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:00.833
<c.Subtitle-C9_2>We've got something important!

00:02:02.541 --> 00:02:03.541
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>Aww.

00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:06.708
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>Don't make me do the

00:02:03.584 --> 00:02:06.708
<c.Subtitle-C11_2>same thing every morning!

00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:22.666
<c.Caption-C23_1>Friends

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.250
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>So, how was it?

00:02:41.291 --> 00:02:44.041
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>Learn anything from the popotan?

00:02:44.083 --> 00:02:45.500
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>Nothing.

00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:49.208
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>Ai said she'll go and ask by the seashore.

00:02:49.208 --> 00:02:50.208
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>I see.

00:02:50.208 --> 00:02:53.083
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>Mai, I'll get off here.

00:02:55.458 --> 00:02:56.166
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>There!

00:02:56.541 --> 00:02:59.125
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>Good morning, Yumi! Chiyo!

00:02:59.166 --> 00:03:00.416
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>Good morning! Puffy cheeks!

00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:05.666
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>Your puffy cheeks are the best!

00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:08.750
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>Puffy cheeks feel so good!

00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:26.750
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>Good morning, Mai.

00:03:27.791 --> 00:03:29.375
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>Uh, um...

00:03:29.416 --> 00:03:31.458
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>Come on, It's Konami! Konami!

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:33.500
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>Haven't you remembered yet?

00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:35.250
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>I'm sorry.

00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:37.500
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>No, no. I'm just kidding.

00:03:37.666 --> 00:03:40.166
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>You only just transferred here, after all.

00:03:40.166 --> 00:03:41.791
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>It's understandable.

00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:47.250
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>But what's the matter? You look tired.

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:49.250
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>Uh, I feel fine.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.541
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>Really?

00:03:50.541 --> 00:03:52.125
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>Then what's up?

00:03:52.416 --> 00:03:53.500
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>What's up?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:54.916
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>Uh, nothing.

00:03:55.416 --> 00:03:57.625
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>Then what were you looking at?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.833
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>Uh, outside.

00:04:03.208 --> 00:04:04.791
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>There you go again.

00:04:04.791 --> 00:04:05.916
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>Huh? Wh-What?

00:04:05.958 --> 00:04:09.583
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>You said the same thing

00:04:05.959 --> 00:04:09.583
<c.Subtitle-C41_2>the day you first came.

00:04:09.625 --> 00:04:12.500
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>I asked you the same thing that day, too.

00:04:13.333 --> 00:04:15.166
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>Really?

00:04:15.375 --> 00:04:17.375
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>Don't you remember?

00:04:17.375 --> 00:04:19.916
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>Maybe I'll ask you tomorrow, too.

00:04:32.625 --> 00:04:35.583
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>Oh, right. Is that so?

00:04:36.291 --> 00:04:37.833
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>Did you find something out?

00:04:38.625 --> 00:04:42.000
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>Yes. Tomorrow's going to be

00:04:38.626 --> 00:04:42.000
<c.Subtitle-C48_2>a nice day, too.

00:04:42.333 --> 00:04:45.000
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>Who cares about that?

00:04:45.791 --> 00:04:49.458
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>Well, I'm going to have to ask

00:04:45.792 --> 00:04:49.458
<c.Subtitle-C50_2>a lot more questions, then.

00:04:49.875 --> 00:04:51.125
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>Yeah.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.666
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>Well, I'm going home.

00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:04.958
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>Mai, be careful when you use

00:05:01.584 --> 00:05:04.958
<c.Subtitle-C53_2>your powers around others.

00:05:04.958 --> 00:05:06.291
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>Don't worry.

00:05:06.291 --> 00:05:07.333
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>No one's around.

00:05:09.041 --> 00:05:09.583
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>There!

00:05:09.583 --> 00:05:11.125
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>Mai!

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:13.208
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>I knew it was you!

00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:16.000
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>What're you doing here?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.666
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>Uh, nothing.

00:05:21.583 --> 00:05:23.791
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>There you go again!

00:05:23.833 --> 00:05:26.916
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>You should come up with

00:05:23.834 --> 00:05:26.916
<c.Subtitle-C62_2>a different answer sometime.

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:34.750
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>Wait for me, Mai!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>So, have you gotten used to

00:05:44.001 --> 00:05:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C64_2>your new school yet?

00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:48.833
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>Yeah, I guess so.

00:05:50.666 --> 00:05:52.916
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>Aren't you going to join

00:05:50.667 --> 00:05:52.916
<c.Subtitle-C66_2>a club or something?

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.541
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>Well, no.

00:05:55.958 --> 00:05:58.875
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>You live out by the point, right?

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.166
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>Yeah.

00:06:05.375 --> 00:06:08.291
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>Hey, what was your old school like?

00:06:08.791 --> 00:06:11.541
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>The school you went to,

00:06:08.792 --> 00:06:11.541
<c.Subtitle-C71_2>before you transferred.

00:06:11.958 --> 00:06:14.125
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>You haven't said anything about it.

00:06:16.041 --> 00:06:16.916
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>Sorry.

00:06:17.458 --> 00:06:19.166
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>I've got to go.

00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:25.250
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>Mai.

00:06:29.208 --> 00:06:30.375
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>I'm home.

00:06:30.416 --> 00:06:32.875
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>Mai! Look! Look!

00:06:35.291 --> 00:06:36.041
<c.Caption-C24_1>Eel

00:06:36.041 --> 00:06:36.750
<c.Caption-C25_1>Crab

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.166
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>Wh-What? What is that?!

00:06:41.166 --> 00:06:43.291
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>When I was at the fish store...

00:06:43.333 --> 00:06:46.500
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>...they gave me an eel that looks

00:06:43.334 --> 00:06:46.500
<c.Subtitle-C80_2>exactly like Unagi!

00:06:46.833 --> 00:06:48.541
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>And we got a crab, too.

00:06:48.541 --> 00:06:49.875
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>They're very fresh.

00:06:50.125 --> 00:06:55.500
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>So, we're going to have a broiled unagi (eel)!

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:57.291
<c.Caption-C26_1>Broiled Unagi

00:06:59.166 --> 00:07:01.083
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>The people here are really nice.

00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:03.958
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>I feel like I want to live here forever!

00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:08.833
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>That's not possible. You know that.

00:07:10.875 --> 00:07:14.750
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>Come on. I know at least that much!

00:07:22.166 --> 00:07:24.458
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>My old school, huh?

00:07:25.875 --> 00:07:29.500
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>How am I supposed to

00:07:25.876 --> 00:07:29.500
<c.Subtitle-C89_2>remember all that?

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.625
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>What a strange girl.

00:07:39.708 --> 00:07:41.625
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>She should just leave me alone.

00:07:47.583 --> 00:07:49.958
<c.Caption-C27_1>Portraiture

00:07:49.958 --> 00:07:55.791
<c.Caption-C28_1>Portraiture

00:07:50.166 --> 00:07:51.791
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>Now, everyone.

00:07:51.791 --> 00:07:56.041
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>I want you to do a sketch of

00:07:51.792 --> 00:07:56.041
<c.Subtitle-C93_2>the person next to you.

00:07:56.291 --> 00:07:58.500
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>Th-The person next to me?

00:08:01.291 --> 00:08:03.166
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>That's me, Mai.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:04.916
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>All right.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.791
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>Why is it always like this?

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:25.041
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>I don't want to feel like that again.

00:08:26.666 --> 00:08:28.666
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>Miss Mai, you have a guest.

00:08:28.791 --> 00:08:29.625
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>Guest?

00:08:29.708 --> 00:08:30.583
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>Yes.

00:08:30.666 --> 00:08:33.583
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>Konami. She said she

00:08:30.667 --> 00:08:33.583
<c.Subtitle-C102_2>was your classmate.

00:08:35.791 --> 00:08:37.500
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>What?!

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:38.625
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>But why?

00:08:39.583 --> 00:08:43.500
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>I mean, we still have homework

00:08:39.584 --> 00:08:43.500
<c.Subtitle-C105_2>for art class, right?

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.791
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>I thought we could work on it together,

00:08:43.501 --> 00:08:46.791
<c.Subtitle-C106_2>and so I came here.

00:08:46.958 --> 00:08:48.916
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>So you came here, huh?

00:08:48.916 --> 00:08:50.541
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>I don't need to do it anymore.

00:08:50.541 --> 00:08:53.250
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>But if we don't do it,

00:08:50.542 --> 00:08:53.250
<c.Subtitle-C109_2>I'm going to be in trouble...

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:54.750
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>...and so will you.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:57.500
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>At this rate, we won't finish in time.

00:08:58.333 --> 00:09:00.375
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>Yeah, but...

00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:03.416
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>How rare!

00:09:03.458 --> 00:09:05.583
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>Mai has a friend visiting!

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.833
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>Oh, my. Welcome.

00:09:08.125 --> 00:09:09.291
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>Uh, no.

00:09:09.333 --> 00:09:10.333
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>Come here a second.

00:09:10.916 --> 00:09:13.166
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>It's a problem when you just show up.

00:09:13.166 --> 00:09:14.833
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>So could you just leave?

00:09:14.875 --> 00:09:15.958
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>Yes, but...

00:09:17.541 --> 00:09:20.708
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>And this is the bath and

00:09:17.542 --> 00:09:20.708
<c.Subtitle-C121_2>the changing room.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.416
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>And our bedrooms are

00:09:20.751 --> 00:09:23.416
<c.Subtitle-C122_2>on the second floor.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.958
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>Wow, what a nice house.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.166
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>Don't be showing strangers

00:09:27.501 --> 00:09:30.166
<c.Subtitle-C124_2>around the house.

00:09:30.166 --> 00:09:31.416
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>Ow!

00:09:31.958 --> 00:09:32.791
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>Mai.

00:09:33.375 --> 00:09:36.458
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>Really, my family members

00:09:33.376 --> 00:09:36.458
<c.Subtitle-C127_2>are very strange...

00:09:36.458 --> 00:09:38.625
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>...so I didn't want you to meet them.

00:09:38.625 --> 00:09:40.750
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>By the way, why do you feel so furry?

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.750
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>This is the dining room.

00:09:50.583 --> 00:09:53.791
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>I made a very special dish tonight...

00:09:53.791 --> 00:09:55.875
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>...so please stay for dinner.

00:09:56.166 --> 00:09:57.583
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>Are you sure?

00:09:57.583 --> 00:09:59.083
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>Thank you very much!

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:03.416
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>You want to make our guest sick?!

00:10:03.416 --> 00:10:04.875
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>What?

00:10:05.375 --> 00:10:08.458
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>Mai, you just called me a guest!

00:10:09.208 --> 00:10:11.500
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>Uh, no, I mean...

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.208
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>Thanks, Mai.

00:10:21.958 --> 00:10:22.916
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>Popotan.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.166
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>Popotan.

00:10:31.916 --> 00:10:34.083
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>This sure is a big house.

00:10:34.083 --> 00:10:35.291
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>It's amazing.

00:10:35.541 --> 00:10:36.750
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>Really?

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:40.125
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>Without Mea, there would be

00:10:36.751 --> 00:10:40.125
<c.Subtitle-C145_2>so much cleaning to do.

00:10:40.916 --> 00:10:43.958
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>Well, if I had to, I could do it myself.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.333
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>Uh, um...

00:10:49.333 --> 00:10:50.375
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>Look.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.208
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>You came here to sketch, right?

00:10:55.541 --> 00:10:57.291
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>Sorry about the other day.

00:10:57.583 --> 00:10:58.375
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>About what?

00:10:58.625 --> 00:11:02.583
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>You seemed uncomfortable when

00:10:58.626 --> 00:11:02.583
<c.Subtitle-C152_2>I asked about your old school.

00:11:02.916 --> 00:11:05.583
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>I must've brought up something

00:11:02.917 --> 00:11:05.583
<c.Subtitle-C153_2>you didn't want to talk about.

00:11:09.916 --> 00:11:12.625
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>I understand how you feel.

00:11:13.791 --> 00:11:16.958
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>I transferred to this school, too.

00:11:17.375 --> 00:11:18.500
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>What?

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:21.250
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>Just before you transferred here.

00:11:21.833 --> 00:11:24.833
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>That's why I want to be friends with you.

00:11:25.291 --> 00:11:26.708
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>You're always alone.

00:11:26.708 --> 00:11:29.375
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>I thought maybe you didn't

00:11:26.709 --> 00:11:29.375
<c.Subtitle-C160_2>get along at school.

00:11:31.041 --> 00:11:35.583
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>I talk to you about things

00:11:31.042 --> 00:11:35.583
<c.Subtitle-C161_2>because I want to be friends.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:39.125
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>But I guess there are things

00:11:36.001 --> 00:11:39.125
<c.Subtitle-C162_2>about your old school...

00:11:39.125 --> 00:11:41.083
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>...you don't want to talk about.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.583
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>I'm sorry.

00:11:44.791 --> 00:11:46.958
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>You haven't done anything wrong, Konami.

00:11:49.875 --> 00:11:51.958
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>I've brought some tea.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.541
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>Uh, thanks.

00:11:55.333 --> 00:11:56.500
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>What's this?

00:11:57.458 --> 00:11:59.166
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>A special blend of tea...

00:11:59.166 --> 00:12:01.208
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>...brewed over three weeks.

00:12:01.208 --> 00:12:02.333
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>Right.

00:12:02.666 --> 00:12:04.666
<c.Subtitle-C172_1>Listen, why don't you take it away?

00:12:04.875 --> 00:12:08.083
<c.Subtitle-C173_1>Oh, come on. At least have a little taste.

00:12:23.083 --> 00:12:24.250
<c.Subtitle-C174_1>I'm sorry.

00:12:24.375 --> 00:12:26.708
<c.Subtitle-C175_1>You'll have to wait 'til your clothes dry.

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:29.750
<c.Subtitle-C176_1>Okay, but I'm so envious.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.208
<c.Subtitle-C177_1>You have such a big bath.

00:12:32.208 --> 00:12:33.958
<c.Subtitle-C178_1>I'm so envious.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.541
<c.Subtitle-C179_1>You have such big puffies.

00:12:38.333 --> 00:12:39.708
<c.Subtitle-C180_1>M-Mii!

00:12:41.625 --> 00:12:44.250
<c.Subtitle-C181_1>Yeah. They're not as big as Ai's...

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:47.291
<c.Subtitle-C182_1>...but they're going to be quite

00:12:44.251 --> 00:12:47.291
<c.Subtitle-C182_2>something in the future.

00:12:47.291 --> 00:12:49.291
<c.Subtitle-C183_1>Mai's, on the other hand, are pathetic.

00:12:49.791 --> 00:12:52.458
<c.Subtitle-C184_1>Just shut your yap! I still have hope!

00:12:52.916 --> 00:12:56.375
<c.Subtitle-C185_1>I suppose. It's important to have faith.

00:12:58.791 --> 00:13:00.291
<c.Subtitle-C186_1>There!

00:13:02.833 --> 00:13:04.500
<c.Subtitle-C187_1>You!

00:13:06.333 --> 00:13:10.208
<c.Subtitle-C188_1>Now, stop it! Don't fight

00:13:06.334 --> 00:13:10.208
<c.Subtitle-C188_2>in front of our guest!

00:13:41.083 --> 00:13:42.666
<c.Subtitle-C189_1>Good morning, Mai!

00:13:45.708 --> 00:13:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C190_1>Good morning, Konami!

00:13:54.583 --> 00:13:55.916
<c.Subtitle-C191_1>Good morning!

00:14:39.208 --> 00:14:40.541
<c.Subtitle-C192_1>I'm home!

00:14:43.375 --> 00:14:44.916
<c.Subtitle-C193_1>Is that right?

00:14:44.916 --> 00:14:45.958
<c.Subtitle-C194_1>I understand.

00:14:45.958 --> 00:14:47.541
<c.Subtitle-C195_1>What? What's going on?

00:14:47.875 --> 00:14:50.458
<c.Subtitle-C196_1>Mea got that feeling again.

00:14:50.458 --> 00:14:51.458
<c.Subtitle-C197_1>Yes.

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:54.416
<c.Subtitle-C198_1>Then, that means...

00:14:54.416 --> 00:14:54.916
<c.Subtitle-C199_1>Yes.

00:14:55.458 --> 00:14:56.958
<c.Subtitle-C200_1>It's too bad.

00:14:57.166 --> 00:14:59.250
<c.Subtitle-C201_1>But I hope we can find out soon.

00:14:59.625 --> 00:15:00.625
<c.Subtitle-C202_1>Yes.

00:15:12.208 --> 00:15:13.375
<c.Subtitle-C203_1>Good morning, Mai!

00:15:15.208 --> 00:15:16.208
<c.Subtitle-C204_1>Good morning.

00:15:16.916 --> 00:15:18.416
<c.Subtitle-C205_1>Hey, Mai.

00:15:18.416 --> 00:15:19.708
<c.Subtitle-C206_1>What's the matter?

00:15:19.708 --> 00:15:20.916
<c.Subtitle-C207_1>Is something the matter?

00:15:21.208 --> 00:15:22.583
<c.Subtitle-C208_1>Uh, nothing.

00:15:42.208 --> 00:15:43.916
<c.Subtitle-C209_1>Hang on, Mai.

00:15:46.166 --> 00:15:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C210_1>What?

00:15:47.166 --> 00:15:50.166
<c.Subtitle-C211_1>We still have to do our art project.

00:15:50.166 --> 00:15:51.708
<c.Subtitle-C212_1>Can we get together tomorrow?

00:15:52.125 --> 00:15:54.375
<c.Subtitle-C213_1>I don't care, so just leave me alone.

00:15:57.041 --> 00:15:59.666
<c.Subtitle-C214_1>Wait! What's the matter, Mai?

00:16:00.041 --> 00:16:02.041
<c.Subtitle-C215_1>Why are you avoiding everyone?

00:16:03.583 --> 00:16:08.083
<c.Subtitle-C216_1>I thought you weren't feeling

00:16:03.584 --> 00:16:08.083
<c.Subtitle-C216_2>accepted at your new school.

00:16:08.083 --> 00:16:10.125
<c.Subtitle-C217_1>But I was wrong!

00:16:10.458 --> 00:16:14.125
<c.Subtitle-C218_1>You're just avoiding me and everyone!

00:16:14.125 --> 00:16:16.666
<c.Subtitle-C219_1>You're purposely not getting along

00:16:14.126 --> 00:16:16.666
<c.Subtitle-C219_2>with anyone here!

00:16:18.666 --> 00:16:19.666
<c.Subtitle-C220_1>That's right.

00:16:19.833 --> 00:16:22.416
<c.Subtitle-C221_1>Why?! Why do you do that?

00:16:22.666 --> 00:16:24.333
<c.Subtitle-C222_1>You'll never understand!

00:16:28.333 --> 00:16:30.708
<c.Subtitle-C223_1>I've transferred from school

00:16:28.334 --> 00:16:30.708
<c.Subtitle-C223_2>to school so many times...

00:16:30.708 --> 00:16:33.708
<c.Subtitle-C224_1>...and I've been everywhere,

00:16:30.709 --> 00:16:33.708
<c.Subtitle-C224_2>making many, many friends.

00:16:34.041 --> 00:16:36.958
<c.Subtitle-C225_1>But I always have to leave.

00:16:37.416 --> 00:16:38.750
<c.Subtitle-C226_1>It happens all the time.

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:41.250
<c.Subtitle-C227_1>You said that you understood how I felt...

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.708
<c.Subtitle-C228_1>...but there's no way!

00:16:42.708 --> 00:16:44.500
<c.Subtitle-C229_1>We're different!

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.875
<c.Subtitle-C230_1>I've had enough! I don't want

00:16:44.501 --> 00:16:47.875
<c.Subtitle-C230_2>to feel that sadness again!

00:16:48.416 --> 00:16:49.958
<c.Subtitle-C231_1>That's why I decided...

00:16:49.958 --> 00:16:51.875
<c.Subtitle-C232_1>...that I'm not going to

00:16:49.959 --> 00:16:51.875
<c.Subtitle-C232_2>get along with anyone.

00:16:51.875 --> 00:16:54.208
<c.Subtitle-C233_1>That I don't want friends.

00:16:56.083 --> 00:16:57.083
<c.Subtitle-C234_1>Mai.

00:16:58.333 --> 00:17:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C235_1>I know that I'm just going to

00:16:58.334 --> 00:17:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C235_2>have to leave again.

00:17:01.041 --> 00:17:03.458
<c.Subtitle-C236_1>If I don't make new friends,

00:17:01.042 --> 00:17:03.458
<c.Subtitle-C236_2>I'm not going to feel sad.

00:17:03.458 --> 00:17:05.541
<c.Subtitle-C237_1>And everyone will just forget.

00:17:05.541 --> 00:17:07.041
<c.Subtitle-C238_1>That's not true!

00:17:07.041 --> 00:17:10.541
<c.Subtitle-C239_1>I'll remember you!

00:17:07.042 --> 00:17:10.541
<c.Subtitle-C239_2>I'll always remember you!

00:17:10.541 --> 00:17:13.083
<c.Subtitle-C240_1>It's easy to say that...

00:17:13.083 --> 00:17:15.583
<c.Subtitle-C241_1>...but you and I are different.

00:17:15.875 --> 00:17:18.166
<c.Subtitle-C242_1>There's no way you can

00:17:15.876 --> 00:17:18.166
<c.Subtitle-C242_2>understand how I feel.

00:17:21.666 --> 00:17:23.250
<c.Subtitle-C243_1>That may be true.

00:17:24.375 --> 00:17:26.333
<c.Subtitle-C244_1>But you're still wrong.

00:17:26.875 --> 00:17:29.625
<c.Subtitle-C245_1>Friends are friends no matter

00:17:26.876 --> 00:17:29.625
<c.Subtitle-C245_2>where you transfer to.

00:17:29.833 --> 00:17:33.666
<c.Subtitle-C246_1>Besides, when you transfer,

00:17:29.834 --> 00:17:33.666
<c.Subtitle-C246_2>you make even more friends.

00:17:34.166 --> 00:17:37.500
<c.Subtitle-C247_1>It's wrong that you don't make friends...

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:39.333
<c.Subtitle-C248_1>...just because you'll be sad

00:17:37.501 --> 00:17:39.333
<c.Subtitle-C248_2>when you leave.

00:17:41.833 --> 00:17:42.708
<c.Subtitle-C249_1>Mai!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.916
<c.Subtitle-C250_1>You're getting in the way, Unagi.

00:17:51.708 --> 00:17:53.833
<c.Subtitle-C251_1>What are you drawing, Mii?

00:17:54.916 --> 00:17:56.000
<c.Subtitle-C252_1>You want to see?

00:17:56.125 --> 00:17:58.958
<c.Subtitle-C253_1>There! It's Yumi and Chiyo!

00:17:59.166 --> 00:18:01.000
<c.Subtitle-C254_1>Well, aren't they cute!

00:18:01.958 --> 00:18:05.375
<c.Subtitle-C255_1>Well, I'm cuter than them both,

00:18:01.959 --> 00:18:05.375
<c.Subtitle-C255_2>of course. Right, Unagi?

00:18:06.333 --> 00:18:09.625
<c.Subtitle-C256_1>Now, what's that supposed to mean?

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:14.958
<c.Subtitle-C257_1>Mai, I'm coming in.

00:18:27.833 --> 00:18:28.750
<c.Subtitle-C258_1>Ai.

00:18:29.458 --> 00:18:30.833
<c.Subtitle-C259_1>Why?

00:18:30.875 --> 00:18:34.791
<c.Subtitle-C260_1>Why do we have to move

00:18:30.876 --> 00:18:34.791
<c.Subtitle-C260_2>over and over again?

00:18:36.333 --> 00:18:37.708
<c.Subtitle-C261_1>Mai.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:38.833
<c.Subtitle-C262_1>Ai.

00:18:39.375 --> 00:18:40.333
<c.Subtitle-C263_1>Ai!

00:18:40.583 --> 00:18:41.875
<c.Subtitle-C264_1>Why is it?!

00:19:07.916 --> 00:19:09.500
<c.Subtitle-C265_1>What a sad face.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.125
<c.Subtitle-C266_1>I wonder if I'll be okay tomorrow.

00:19:14.708 --> 00:19:16.916
<c.Subtitle-C267_1>I suppose it doesn't matter anymore.

00:19:16.916 --> 00:19:18.583
<c.Subtitle-C268_1>Mai!

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:20.625
<c.Subtitle-C269_1>Mai!

00:19:21.083 --> 00:19:22.833
<c.Subtitle-C270_1>Mai!

00:19:29.166 --> 00:19:30.333
<c.Subtitle-C271_1>Why?

00:19:31.958 --> 00:19:34.375
<c.Subtitle-C272_1>You left your bike, right?

00:19:34.375 --> 00:19:36.250
<c.Subtitle-C273_1>I figure you'll need it tomorrow.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:38.166
<c.Subtitle-C274_1>Uh, thanks.

00:19:39.666 --> 00:19:41.833
<c.Subtitle-C275_1>And here's this.

00:19:45.708 --> 00:19:46.875
<c.Subtitle-C276_1>Look at it.

00:19:51.666 --> 00:19:55.041
<c.Subtitle-C277_1>This is the face of the Mai I know.

00:19:55.708 --> 00:19:57.250
<c.Subtitle-C278_1>I'll remember it.

00:19:58.166 --> 00:20:00.583
<c.Subtitle-C279_1>I'll never forget it.

00:20:01.375 --> 00:20:04.083
<c.Subtitle-C280_1>So, this is how I look?

00:20:04.833 --> 00:20:08.166
<c.Subtitle-C281_1>But the real Mai is even more pretty.

00:20:10.666 --> 00:20:12.083
<c.Subtitle-C282_1>You're crazy.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.041
<c.Subtitle-C283_1>I'll never forget.

00:20:23.375 --> 00:20:25.916
<c.Subtitle-C284_1>I'll never forget, either.

00:20:27.041 --> 00:20:28.041
<c.Subtitle-C285_1>Yeah.

00:20:29.375 --> 00:20:31.750
<c.Subtitle-C286_1>See you tomorrow, Konami.

00:20:33.083 --> 00:20:33.916
<c.Subtitle-C287_1>Okay.

00:20:53.166 --> 00:20:54.708
<c.Subtitle-C288_1>No way.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:10.416
<c.Caption-C29_1>Thank you.

00:21:08.251 --> 00:21:10.416
<c.Caption-C29_2>Goodbye.

00:21:18.833 --> 00:21:19.958
<c.Subtitle-C289_1>Mai.

00:21:31.875 --> 00:21:34.500
<c.Subtitle-C290_1>Come on! Wake up!

00:21:34.541 --> 00:21:36.458
<c.Subtitle-C291_1>No, not that button.

00:21:39.416 --> 00:21:40.500
<c.Subtitle-C292_1>Come on! Get up now!

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:42.958
<c.Subtitle-C293_1>Always a fuss in the morning.

00:21:40.501 --> 00:21:42.958
<c.Subtitle-C293_2>Come on! Get up now!

00:21:43.958 --> 00:21:46.625
<c.Subtitle-C294_1>Oh, no! I'm not going to make it!

00:21:52.666 --> 00:21:54.500
<c.Subtitle-C295_1>I'm off!

00:22:11.875 --> 00:22:15.125
<c.Caption-C30_1>Tekuno panku de aishitetainoyo

00:22:15.125 --> 00:22:18.625
<c.Caption-C31_1>Denpa ni nosete daisuki suki suki

00:22:18.625 --> 00:22:22.125
<c.Caption-C32_1>Romanchikku wo anatani agetai

00:22:22.125 --> 00:22:23.750
<c.Caption-C33_1>Waratte hoshii

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:25.541
<c.Caption-C34_1>I love, love, love you

00:22:25.541 --> 00:22:28.833
<c.Caption-C35_1>S.U.K.I. dokidoki love

00:22:28.833 --> 00:22:32.333
<c.Caption-C36_1>S.U.K.I. gimigimi kiss

00:22:32.333 --> 00:22:35.875
<c.Caption-C37_1>S.U.K.I. sukisuki love

00:22:35.875 --> 00:22:39.500
<c.Caption-C38_1>S.U.K.I. sukiari kiss

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:41.208
<c.Caption-C39_1>Mawaru mawaru

00:22:41.208 --> 00:22:43.125
<c.Caption-C40_1>Jikuu no hariga

00:22:43.125 --> 00:22:46.583
<c.Caption-C41_1>Kimi to boku no zahyou wo sasuno

00:22:46.583 --> 00:22:49.750
<c.Caption-C42_1>Toketeikuwa ai no himitsu

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:54.125
<c.Caption-C43_1>Dokidoki surukoto madamada shiritaiwa

00:22:56.708 --> 00:23:03.416
<c.Caption-C44_1>Every boy, every girl kiseki wo

00:22:56.709 --> 00:23:03.416
<c.Caption-C44_2>shinjitara mirakuru kurukuru

00:23:03.875 --> 00:23:10.375
<c.Caption-C45_1>Kitto mitsukaruwa beriberi

00:23:03.876 --> 00:23:10.375
<c.Caption-C45_2>surotoberi dei beriberi beriberi

00:23:10.708 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C46_1>Itsuka sayonara ga

00:23:10.709 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C46_2>yattekitatte daijoubunakurai

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:21.541
<c.Caption-C47_1>Motto anatani sukisuki daisuki tsutaetai

00:23:21.541 --> 00:23:24.625
<c.Caption-C48_1>I love you! I, I love you!

00:23:27.958 --> 00:23:30.208
<c.Subtitle-C296_1>Transform! Una!

00:23:41.208 --> 00:23:44.958
<c.Subtitle-C297_1>Well, was I cute in that episode?

00:23:46.083 --> 00:24:03.250
<c.Caption-C49_1>Magic

00:23:47.208 --> 00:23:50.083
<c.Subtitle-C298_1>Okay, the next episode

00:23:47.209 --> 00:23:50.083
<c.Subtitle-C298_2>of Popotan is "Magic".

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:53.291
<c.Subtitle-C299_1>Your favorite animal

00:23:50.251 --> 00:23:53.291
<c.Subtitle-C299_2>will be there next time, too!

00:23:53.291 --> 00:23:54.958
<c.Subtitle-C300_1>Which means I'm going to play

00:23:53.292 --> 00:23:54.958
<c.Subtitle-C300_2>my part for real this time!

00:23:54.958 --> 00:23:57.875
<c.Subtitle-C301_1>In fact, this time

00:23:54.959 --> 00:23:57.875
<c.Subtitle-C301_2>I should be taking center stage!

00:23:57.875 --> 00:24:00.583
<c.Subtitle-C302_1>The magical princess is really

00:23:57.876 --> 00:24:00.583
<c.Subtitle-C302_2>supposed to be my sidekick!

00:24:00.583 --> 00:24:03.000
<c.Subtitle-C303_1>But the higher-ups don't seem

00:24:00.584 --> 00:24:03.000
<c.Subtitle-C303_2>to understand this!

00:24:07.458 --> 00:24:09.708
<c.Subtitle-C304_1>Good night, everyone!
